sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant C as Klien (token user)
    participant G as Gateway (PEP)
    participant PE as Policy Engine (Tabel 3)
    participant DB as MySQL (atribut)
    participant S as Service Nilai :3001
    participant A as AuditService

    C->>G: PUT /nilai/1<br/>Bearer + X-Device-ID + body
    Note over G: request-id → authenticate
    alt token tidak valid / kedaluwarsa
        G-->>C: 401 TOKEN_INVALID / TOKEN_EXPIRED
        G->>A: catat deny
    else token valid
        G->>PE: authorize('nilai.update')
        Note over PE: urutan deny: scope → device/state →<br/>role → jam akses → aturan
        PE->>DB: SELECT kelas.dosen_id, nilai.status<br/>(atribut dari DB, bukan dari token)
        alt deny
            PE-->>G: deny(reason)
            G-->>C: 403 reason (NOT_CLASS_OWNER /<br/>OUTSIDE_ACCESS_HOURS / GRADE_ALREADY_FINAL)
            G->>A: catat deny(reason) — reason = error.code
        else allow
            PE-->>G: allow(CLASS_OWNER)
            G->>A: catat allow(CLASS_OWNER)
            G->>S: proxy: header secret klien DIHAPUS,<br/>X-Gateway-Secret asli + Bearer + device
            S->>S: verifyGatewaySecret (timingSafeEqual)<br/> DAN verifikasi ulang token (RS256, public key)
            S->>DB: UPDATE nilai ... WHERE dosen_id=? AND status='DRAFT'
            Note over S,DB: re-check atomik (D11) — affectedRows=0 ⇒ tolak
            S-->>G: 200 / 403 hasil guard
            G-->>C: respons + X-Request-ID
        end
    end
